cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the PhysioNet/CinC Challenge 2019 data it was built on."
title: "SepsiScope: explainable, alarm-budgeted sepsis early warning"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SepsiScope contributors"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kabir-sinha/sepsiscope"
abstract: "A research prototype (not for clinical use) that predicts sepsis hours before onset from routine ICU data under a fixed 5 % alarm budget, with explanations, validated strictly across two hospitals of the PhysioNet/CinC Challenge 2019."
keywords:
  - sepsis
  - early warning
  - machine learning
  - explainability
  - external validation
  - PhysioNet
